<title>USA: PHLX says to list options on Nuevo Energy.</title>
<headline>PHLX says to list options on Nuevo Energy.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said on Wednesday it would begin trading options on shares of Nuevo Energy Co on September 4.</p>
<p>The exchange said the options will trade on the January expiration cycle, with initial expiration months of September, October, January and February. Initial strike prices will be 30, 35 and 40, it said.</p>
<p>TFM Investment Group will be the specialist for the options, the PHLX said.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
